{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Theirs is a journey defined by unmatched instinct, endless resilience, and the ambition of a creature that, for the sake of all generations yet to come, cannot afford to fail.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/waterfall_vibes.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as a salmon</strong> journeying home in this challenging physics based platformer using only two buttons! Remember that on a voyage through innumerable obstacles and constant danger, it is your reaction to adversity that determines your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/beach_jump.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Swim and jump</strong> your way to the Mountain Spring as a spawning salmon using only a left and right button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse environments based on different ecosystems from the <strong>Pacific Northwest</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an <strong>educational and emotional story</strong> about the life cycle of a salmon with a bit of encouragement along the way if your progress isn\u2019t always forward (or up).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Satisfy your completionist side by collecting <strong>salmonberries</strong> and <strong>salmon sense</strong>, and by finding all the <strong>secret areas</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the game at your own pace with <strong>accessibility settings</strong> like: <i>Key Rebinding</i>, <i>Hold-to-Swim</i>, and <i>Quicksave Mode</i>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A <strong>cute</strong> salmon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/salmon_swimming.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/salmon_falling.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The reality of a spawning salmon is treacherous, so this will be a challenge for even the most seasoned <strong>platformers and speedrunners</strong>. Keep an eye out for alternative paths on your voyage.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/salmonberry.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game with only <strong>two buttons</strong> can\u2019t be that hard right?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Legacy of Endurance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/9844442c0dc990e024209c25dd5f133cafc7e2cd.jpg"},{"name":"Things do not Always go as Planned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/a25fb2bfd59c3b284e3c2e7b95a013fc212761fc.jpg"},{"name":"Shortcut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/bbe03d560ad31e70de5baad934f2499f112e23b5.jpg"},{"name":"MINE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/7173c2726b36c72faf7f18de6b710c9f7a5ac233.jpg"},{"name":"Are You Gonna Fix That?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/fccf2ed203b047fe7459a7476ee3fd62f54713d8.jpg"},{"name":"Are you Feeling it Now?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/4c70743bb75e6bf78f140a17d8c20479e34a25b8.jpg"},{"name":"Fun in the Sun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/8d23a3f58892f6ad2734fbad0297ca7b8f68e48a.jpg"},{"name":"Smell Alone is Not Enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/ba30999e805bdf27ba47feeeb9f3f4487cc1658c.jpg"},{"name":"A Concussive State","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/d3e58bc8df6e872c1baca52c94dc35751967c388.jpg"},{"name":"Tasty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3245890/29afb5f43be0b3302c52719469e2bdc5fe6eb645.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3245890?t=1742950902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742950902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/906bc24ba1613ad0589ec5818e985cef8eb16e49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742950902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/906bc24ba1613ad0589ec5818e985cef8eb16e49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742950902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3492540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Theirs is a journey defined by unmatched instinct, endless resilience, and the ambition of a creature that, for the sake of all generations yet to come, cannot afford to fail.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245890/extras/waterfall_vibes.gif?t=1742950902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play as a salmon</strong> 